            <note corresp="#d64-f2" n="2" xml:id="d64-f2-content">
                <p>Marginal notation: “Acted upon by tel — to Paris 8/25”. This refers presumably to
                    Department’s telegram 3306, August 25, to Paris, <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >infra</hi>.</p>
            </note>
